<title>USA: TeleSpectrum sees Q2 loss.</title>
<headline>TeleSpectrum sees Q2 loss.</headline>
<dateline>KING OF PRUSSIA, Penn. 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>TeleSpectrum Worldwide Inc said Friday it expected a &quot;slight loss&quot; in the second quarter ending June 30.</p>
<p>A First Call consensus dated April 29 had put TeleSpectrum's second-quarter earnings at a $0.15 profit per share.</p>
<p>Trading in the company's stock was halted on Nasdaq.</p>
</text>
